# Third-party sources pulled or overlaid by this package

| Component | Upstream | Licence | Form |
|---|---|---|---|
| virt-manager | https://github.com/virt-manager/virt-manager | GPL-2.0-or-later | source tarball, patched |
| QEMU | https://www.qemu.org | GPL-2.0-or-later | source tarball |
| VMVGA | https://github.com/qemus/qemu-vmvga | GPL-2.0-or-later | source overlay onto QEMU |
| dxvk-native | https://github.com/doitsujin/dxvk | Zlib | prebuilt release or source build |
| virglrenderer | https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/virgl/virglrenderer | MIT | source build |
| OVMF / edk2 | https://github.com/tianocore/edk2 | BSD-2-Clause-Patent | prebuilt images; `patches/ovmf/` + `tools/build-ovmf.sh` reproduce them |
| qemu-embed-shim.so | this project | GPL-2.0-or-later | source; built at install |

No third-party source is modified in this repository. VMVGA is copied
verbatim into a QEMU build tree, and QEMU/virt-manager receive only the
patch series under `patches/`.

`share/vendor/NOTICE-shim.md` records the shim build and current hash.
